WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.000
Throughout America's adventure in free government our basic purposes have been to keep the peace,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.360
to foster progress in human achievement, and to enhance liberty, dignity, and integrity among peoples

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:18.340
and among nations. Progress toward these noble goals is persistently threatened by the conflict

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:26.360
now engulfing the world. It commands our whole attention, absorbs our very being. Global in scope,

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:35.300
atheistic in character, ruthless in purpose, and insidious in method. Unhappily the danger it poses

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:44.040
promises to be of indefinite duration. To meet it successfully, there is call for, not so much the emotional

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:52.080
and transitory sacrifices of crisis, but rather those which enable us to carry forward steadily, surely,

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:59.960
and without complaint the burdens of a prolonged and complex struggle with liberty, the stake.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:07.520
Crises they will continue to be. In meeting them whether foreign or domestic, great or small,

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:13.300
there is a recurring temptation to feel that some spectacular and costly action

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:17.260
could become the miraculous solution to all current difficulties.

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:24.060
But each proposal must be weighed in the light of a broader consideration: the need to maintain balance

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:32.560
in and among national programs, balance between our essential requirements as a nation and the duties

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:40.140
imposed by the nation upon the individual, balance between actions of the moment and the national welfare

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:49.060
of the future. Good judgement seeks balance and progress. Lack of it eventually finds imbalance

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:57.600
and frustration. You and I, my fellow citizens need to be strong in our faith that all nations, under God,

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:05.460
will reach the goal of peace with justice. May we be ever unswerving in devotion to principle,

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:11.600
confident but humble with power, diligent in pursuit of the Nation's great goals.

